pple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/Tap-to-Pay-on-iPhone-Wix-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Tap-to-Pay-on-iPhone-Wix\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16124,\"date\":\"2026-07-10T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-10T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-ferma-firma-vecchi-ios-restore-downgrade-iphone-ipad\",\"title\":\"Apple ferma la firma di vecchi iOS: niente restore/downgrade per alcuni iPhone e iPad\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha smesso di firmare alcune versioni di iOS per modelli legacy cellulari. Per chi possiede quei dispositivi si chiudono le strade di restore e downgrade via OTA o IPSW.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/iPhone-5c-Yellow-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-5c-Yellow\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":10,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16097,\"date\":\"2026-07-09T12:46:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-09T10:46:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-perde-battaglia-ue-gatekeeper-app-store-ios\",\"title\":\"Apple perde la battaglia UE sul “gatekeeper” di App Store e iOS\",\"excerpt\":\"La Corte Generale europea ha respinto il ricorso di Apple contro la designazione dell’App Store e di iOS come “gatekeeper” ai sensi del Digital Markets Act, confermando gli obblighi previsti per i servizi designati.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/07/App-Store-vs-EU-Feature-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"App-Store-vs-EU-Feature-2\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":16085,\"date\":\"2026-07-09T08:44:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-07-09T06:44